      "en": "Aaron said to them, “Take off the golden rings, which are in the ears of your wives, of your sons, and of your daughters, and bring them to me.”",
      "ko": "아론이 그들에게 이르되 너희 아내와 자녀의 귀의 금고리를 빼어 내게로 가져 오라",
      "source_text_hash": "b32e18a8f29f700f32904011544497385e60b71e65f542da77aff4aea011cb9f",
      "translation_text_hash": "5e5a4d5731efefa01b136c55727fb28757d8eee8536d48fa8c37d55066ffeb61",
