      "en": "Moses turned, and went down from the mountain, with the two tablets of the covenant in his hand; tablets that were written on both their sides. They were written on one side and on the other.",
      "ko": "모세가 돌이켜 산에서 내려 오는데 증거의 두 판이 그 손에 있고 그 판의 양면 이편 저편에 글자가 있으니",
      "source_text_hash": "a75f4e25e4c3a2c6de4861349d7e2d9813b184ef3e751c9dc3b21896d79ab025",
      "translation_text_hash": "c79ea422ec1687eaec003a9e896b2765efa14bfc0b9255342e2dc9135b10bdb7",
