      "en": "The LORD said to Moses, “Whoever has sinned against me, I will blot him out of my book.",
      "ko": "여호와께서 모세에게 이르시되 누구든지 내게 범죄하면 그는 내가 내 책에서 지워버리리라",
      "source_text_hash": "073464f1a784c9a62cd2bca414f718666c1afaf21566586c39162648974c4f16",
      "translation_text_hash": "91ac043fbfccab6c251e7ca0d904ec7b093c244474000f3109a22497c4a488d1",
